   "title": "阅读程序（一）· 各位数字之和",
   "html": "<div class=\"code-block\"><div class=\"cb-bar\"><span class=\"lang\">C++</span><button class=\"copy-btn\">复制</button></div><div class=\"code-scroll\"><table class=\"hl\"><tbody><tr><td class=\"ln\">1</td><td class=\"code\"><span class=\"cpp-src\">int s=0, t=n;</span></td></tr><tr><td class=\"ln\">2</td><td class=\"code\"><span class=\"cpp-src\">while(t){ s += t % 10; t /= 10; }</span></td></tr><tr><td class=\"ln\">3</td><td class=\"code\"><span class=\"cpp-src\">cout &lt;&lt; s;</span></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div>    <div class=\"quiz\" data-qid=\"rt1\" data-type=\"single\" data-correct=\"0\" data-module=\"algo\"><div class=\"q-q\">若输入 n = 123，程序输出？</div><div class=\"q-opts\"><label class=\"q-opt\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"quiz_rt1\" value=\"0\"><span class=\"q-l\">A</span><span class=\"q-t\">6</span></label><label class=\"q-opt\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"quiz_rt1\" value=\"1\"><span class=\"q-l\">B</span><span class=\"q-t\">5</span></label><label class=\"q-opt\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"quiz_rt1\" value=\"2\"><span class=\"q-l\">C</span><span class=\"q-t\">3</span></label><label class=\"q-opt\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"quiz_rt1\" value=\"3\"><span class=\"q-l\">D</span><span class=\"q-t\">123</span></label></div><div class=\"q-bar\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"btn q-submit\">提交答案</button><span class=\"q-fb\"></span></div><div class=\"q-explain\" hidden><div class=\"q-explain-hd\">✅ 正确答案：<b>A</b></div><div class=\"q-explain-bd\">1+2+3 = <b>6</b>。每次取末位 t%10 累加后去掉末位。</div><div class=\"q-wrong\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"btn ghost q-towrong\">📕 加入错题本</button></div></div></div><div class=\"quiz\" data-qid=\"rt2\" data-type=\"single\" data-correct=\"0\" data-module=\"algo\"><div class=\"q-q\">该程序的时间复杂度约为？</div><div class=\"q-opts\"><label class=\"q-opt\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"quiz_rt2\" value=\"0\"><span class=\"q-l\">A</span><span class=\"q-t\">O(log₁₀n)（位数）</span></label><label class=\"q-opt\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"quiz_rt2\" value=\"1\"><span class=\"q-l\">B</span><span class=\"q-t\">O(n)</span></label><label class=\"q-opt\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"quiz_rt2\" value=\"2\"><span class=\"q-l\">C</span><span class=\"q-t\">O(n²)</span></label><label class=\"q-opt\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"quiz_rt2\" value=\"3\"><span class=\"q-l\">D</span><span class=\"q-t\">O(1)</span></label></div><div class=\"q-bar\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"btn q-submit\">提交答案</button><span class=\"q-fb\"></span></div><div class=\"q-explain\" hidden><div class=\"q-explain-hd\">✅ 正确答案：<b>A</b></div><div class=\"q-explain-bd\">循环次数 = n 的十进制位数，约 <b>O(log₁₀n)</b>。</div><div class=\"q-wrong\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"btn ghost q-towrong\">📕 加入错题本</button></div></div></div>",
   "text": "C++ 复制 1 int s=0, t=n; 2 while(t){ s += t % 10; t /= 10; } 3 cout << s; 若输入 n = 123，程序输出？ A 6 B 5 C 3 D 123 提交答案 ✅ 正确答案： A 1+2+3 = 6 。每次取末位 t%10 累加后去掉末位。 📕 加入错题本 该程序的时间复杂度约为？ A O(log₁₀n)（位数） B O(n) C O(n²) D O(1) 提交答案 ✅ 正确答案： A 循环次数 = n 的十进制位数，约 O(log₁₀n) 。 📕 加入错题本"
  },
