   "id": "p2",
   "title": "阅读程序（二）· 递归阶乘",
   "html": "<div class=\"code-block\"><div class=\"cb-bar\"><span class=\"lang\">C++</span><button class=\"copy-btn\">复制</button></div><div class=\"code-scroll\"><table class=\"hl\"><tbody><tr><td class=\"ln\">1</td><td class=\"code\"><span class=\"cpp-src\">int f(int n){ return n&lt;=1 ? 1 : n * f(n-1); }</span></td></tr><tr><td class=\"ln\">2</td><td class=\"code\"><span class=\"cpp-src\">cout &lt;&lt; f(5);</span></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div>    <div class=\"quiz\" data-qid=\"rt3\" data-type=\"single\" data-correct=\"0\" data-module=\"algo\"><div class=\"q-q\">程序输出 f(5) 的值是？</div><div class=\"q-opts\"><label class=\"q-opt\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"quiz_rt3\" value=\"0\"><span class=\"q-l\">A</span><span class=\"q-t\">120</span></label><label class=\"q-opt\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"quiz_rt3\" value=\"1\"><span class=\"q-l\">B</span><span class=\"q-t\">24</span></label><label class=\"q-opt\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"quiz_rt3\" value=\"2\"><span class=\"q-l\">C</span><span class=\"q-t\">60</span></label><label class=\"q-opt\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"quiz_rt3\" value=\"3\"><span class=\"q-l\">D</span><span class=\"q-t\">1</span></label></div><div class=\"q-bar\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"btn q-submit\">提交答案</button><span class=\"q-fb\"></span></div><div class=\"q-explain\" hidden><div class=\"q-explain-hd\">✅ 正确答案：<b>A</b></div><div class=\"q-explain-bd\">5! = 5·4·3·2·1 = <b>120</b>。</div><div class=\"q-wrong\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"btn ghost q-towrong\">📕 加入错题本</button></div></div></div><div class=\"quiz\" data-qid=\"rt4\" data-type=\"single\" data-correct=\"0\" data-module=\"algo\"><div class=\"q-q\">该递归版本的时间复杂度约为？</div><div class=\"q-opts\"><label class=\"q-opt\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"quiz_rt4\" value=\"0\"><span class=\"q-l\">A</span><span class=\"q-t\">O(n)</span></label><label class=\"q-opt\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"quiz_rt4\" value=\"1\"><span class=\"q-l\">B</span><span class=\"q-t\">O(2ⁿ)</span></label><label class=\"q-opt\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"quiz_rt4\" value=\"2\"><span class=\"q-l\">C</span><span class=\"q-t\">O(n²)</span></label><label class=\"q-opt\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"quiz_rt4\" value=\"3\"><span class=\"q-l\">D</span><span class=\"q-t\">O(log n)</span></label></div><div class=\"q-bar\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"btn q-submit\">提交答案</button><span class=\"q-fb\"></span></div><div class=\"q-explain\" hidden><div class=\"q-explain-hd\">✅ 正确答案：<b>A</b></div><div class=\"q-explain-bd\">递归深度 n，每层常数操作，复杂度 <b>O(n)</b>。</div><div class=\"q-wrong\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"btn ghost q-towrong\">📕 加入错题本</button></div></div></div>",
   "text": "C++ 复制 1 int f(int n){ return n<=1 ? 1 : n * f(n-1); } 2 cout << f(5); 程序输出 f(5) 的值是？ A 120 B 24 C 60 D 1 提交答案 ✅ 正确答案： A 5! = 5·4·3·2·1 = 120 。 📕 加入错题本 该递归版本的时间复杂度约为？ A O(n) B O(2ⁿ) C O(n²) D O(log n) 提交答案 ✅ 正确答案： A 递归深度 n，每层常数操作，复杂度 O(n) 。 📕 加入错题本"
  },
