   "html": "<div class=\"code-block\"><div class=\"cb-bar\"><span class=\"lang\">C++</span><button class=\"copy-btn\">复制</button></div><div class=\"code-scroll\"><table class=\"hl\"><tbody><tr><td class=\"ln\">1</td><td class=\"code\"><span class=\"cpp-src\">int a[]={1,3,5,7,9};</span></td></tr><tr><td class=\"ln\">2</td><td class=\"code\"><span class=\"cpp-src\">int s=0;</span></td></tr><tr><td class=\"ln\">3</td><td class=\"code\"><span class=\"cpp-src\">for(int i=1;i&lt;=3;i++) s += a[i];</span></td></tr><tr><td class=\"ln\">4</td><td class=\"code\"><span class=\"cpp-src\">cout &lt;&lt; s;</span></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div>    <div class=\"quiz\" data-qid=\"rt5\" data-type=\"single\" data-correct=\"0\" data-module=\"algo\"><div class=\"q-q\">程序输出？</div><div class=\"q-opts\"><label class=\"q-opt\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"quiz_rt5\" value=\"0\"><span class=\"q-l\">A</span><span class=\"q-t\">15</span></label><label class=\"q-opt\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"quiz_rt5\" value=\"1\"><span class=\"q-l\">B</span><span class=\"q-t\">25</span></label><label class=\"q-opt\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"quiz_rt5\" value=\"2\"><span class=\"q-l\">C</span><span class=\"q-t\">9</span></label><label class=\"q-opt\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"quiz_rt5\" value=\"3\"><span class=\"q-l\">D</span><span class=\"q-t\">21</span></label></div><div class=\"q-bar\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"btn q-submit\">提交答案</button><span class=\"q-fb\"></span></div><div class=\"q-explain\" hidden><div class=\"q-explain-hd\">✅ 正确答案：<b>A</b></div><div class=\"q-explain-bd\">a[1]+a[2]+a[3] = 3+5+7 = <b>15</b>（注意下标从 0 开始）。</div><div class=\"q-wrong\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"btn ghost q-towrong\">📕 加入错题本</button></div></div></div><div class=\"quiz\" data-qid=\"rt6\" data-type=\"single\" data-correct=\"0\" data-module=\"algo\"><div class=\"q-q\">若把 i&lt;=3 改成 i&lt;=4，输出？</div><div class=\"q-opts\"><label class=\"q-opt\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"quiz_rt6\" value=\"0\"><span class=\"q-l\">A</span><span class=\"q-t\">24</span></label><label class=\"q-opt\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"quiz_rt6\" value=\"1\"><span class=\"q-l\">B</span><span class=\"q-t\">15</span></label><label class=\"q-opt\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"quiz_rt6\" value=\"2\"><span class=\"q-l\">C</span><span class=\"q-t\">25</span></label><label class=\"q-opt\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"quiz_rt6\" value=\"3\"><span class=\"q-l\">D</span><span class=\"q-t\">34</span></label></div><div class=\"q-bar\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"btn q-submit\">提交答案</button><span class=\"q-fb\"></span></div><div class=\"q-explain\" hidden><div class=\"q-explain-hd\">✅ 正确答案：<b>A</b></div><div class=\"q-explain-bd\">多累加 a[4]=9，得 3+5+7+9 = <b>24</b>。</div><div class=\"q-wrong\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"btn ghost q-towrong\">📕 加入错题本</button></div></div></div>",
   "text": "C++ 复制 1 int a[]={1,3,5,7,9}; 2 int s=0; 3 for(int i=1;i<=3;i++) s += a[i]; 4 cout << s; 程序输出？ A 15 B 25 C 9 D 21 提交答案 ✅ 正确答案： A a[1]+a[2]+a[3] = 3+5+7 = 15 （注意下标从 0 开始）。 📕 加入错题本 若把 i<=3 改成 i<=4，输出？ A 24 B 15 C 25 D 34 提交答案 ✅ 正确答案： A 多累加 a[4]=9，得 3+5+7+9 = 24 。 📕 加入错题本"
  },
